+//  - Now and next (Today card, #now-next): today as one strip (events, shifts, travel, free time, a "now" line) and the 3 tasks that
+//    best fit the free time you have right now. It only reads; the task rows use the app's own done / details / focus actions.
+//  - Catch up (Today card when 2+ tasks are overdue, #catch-up): spreads overdue tasks over the free time of the next 7 days. You see
+//    the plan first and can change any task; Apply saves through commit() after snapshot(), so the toast offers Undo.
+//  - Smarter quick add (Quick capture and the Today quick add): "gym tue thu 7am", "Outback fri 4-10pm", "deep work 2h tomorrow",
